-Java Features: (Tagline: WORA --> Write Once, Run Anywhere)
--------------
1. Simple: Confusing concepts from C language removed in Java
2. Platform Independent: Platform means an environment where we are going to run program eg: OS(Mediator between User and Computer)

C Language => object code => Machine code(binary)

