JVM will not execute program directly, it will check which machine it is when we are runnning program -> It converts program into machine understandable format
If you install java software then JVM also installed. when you run program JVM will comes automatically .java file compiled generate .class file
JVM(Java Virtual Machine) made Java as platform Independent. JVM is responsible to run/execute Java Programs
3.Robust: Strong programming language, following 2 reasons
-Automatic memory management(Memory allocation + deallocation)
-Self Healing capacity(Exception Handling)
4. OOPs(Object Oriented Programming System):
-Everything will be represented in Objectt format
-Code Reusablility
5. Secure: Virus can attack on object code, but cannot attack on Byte code
6. Distributed Systems: In Java, code is not needed to execute sequentially
7. Portable: Easily Java program can be transfered from one machine to another machine
8. Java is Dynamic

